---
description: Git commit message format for materials-kg
---

Generate the commit message text. Do **not** add files, stage, or push the commit — only output the message.

## Commit Message Requirements

- Concise, structured, strictly relevant to the changes in the commit
- Keep length to necessary minimum. No blabber.
- Only create commits when explicitly asked by the user

### Examples
```
Add hybrid search module with vector + graph traversal
Fix builder entity type enum usage
Update README with scripts/ directory in project structure
```

## Agent Files Reference

All 5 agent-facing files must stay consistent. If one is overwritten, check the others:

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md) | **Source of truth** — full conventions, dev commands, structure |
| [`.agents/skills/materials-knowledge-graph/SKILL.md`](../.agents/skills/materials-knowledge-graph/SKILL.md) | Domain skill — architecture, entity/relation types, query examples |
| [`.cursor/rules/materials-kg-agent.mdc`](./materials-kg-agent.mdc) | Coding rules, domain overview, key patterns |
| [`.cursor/rules/terminal.mdc`](./terminal.mdc) | Terminal setup, venv, common commands |
| `.cursor/rules/commit.mdc` (this file) | Commit message format and guidelines |
